0","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p002","quote":"少倜儻有大志，為本州主簿，舉秀才，不行。桓玄將篡，新野人庾仄起兵於南陽，襲雍州刺史馮該，該走。弘之時在江陵，與仄兄子彬謀殺荊州刺史桓石康，以荊州刺史應仄。彬從弟宏知其謀，以告石康，石康收彬殺之，繫弘之於獄。桓玄以弘之非造謀，又白衣無兵眾，原不罪。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p002:m0058","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-048-fuhongzhi:p002:m0055"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"依兩端具名原句，無中間父名或共同祖名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p021:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"庾仄","kind":"person","person_id":"g3n_ce4_ubd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"庾仄","kind":"person","person_id":"g3n_ce4_ubd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"仄","kind":"person","person_id":"g3n_ce4_ubd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"仄","kind":"person","person_id":"g3n_ce4_ubd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p018:m0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"仄","kind":"person","person_id":"g3n_ce4_ubd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragrap